Rejected: one reconcile over all fleets at the top of drive — a hung gh on one fleet held every other fleet's pass and broke #896's parallel-pass test
Decided: the sim's golden metrics and the hunt's start seeds are re-pinned, as #899 and #984 did
Because: q1723
Decided: the webhook fast-step test counts PR reads only, since the closed-issue read must run every fast pass
Because: "An issue closed on GitHub leaves the in-progress group (queue, `status`, Queue screen) within one fast pass"
Rejected: skip the closed read between webhook polls — the webhook receiver handles no issues deliveries, so a close would wait up to webhook_poll_minutes
Check: cargo test -p drover --test sim, --test webhook and --test drive_kicks pass at the head
